  "summary": "Malicious code in @onereach/orest-vue3 (npm)",
  "details": "The package @onereach/orest-vue3 (a Vue3 component library) runs a preinstall hook on install that downloads the Bun JavaScript runtime and executes a bundled 727KB heavily-obfuscated script (math_init.js) with it. The script is a single line of custom base64-style obfuscation containing eval/Function/child_process usage, making its behaviour opaque to inspection. A component library has no legitimate need to download a runtime and execute an obfuscated payload during installation.",
